<title>UK: Rolimpex signs $20 mln accord with EBRD.</title>
<headline>Rolimpex signs $20 mln accord with EBRD.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) said on Friday it had signed a $20 million financing framework agreement with Polish agribusiness firm, Rolimpex S.A.</p>
<p>&quot;The financing framework agreement signed today will enable the EBRD to finance jointly with Rolimpex a number of investment projects in important segments of Poland's agribusiness sector,&quot; bank president Jacques de Larosiere said in a statement.</p>
<p>The EBRD acquired 10 percent of the firm earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Lewa Pardomuan, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5887</p>
